{%- comment -%}
  One row of the diamond spec table.

  A spec the feed didn't supply renders as an em dash rather than being
  dropped, so the table says "we don't know this" instead of quietly
  implying the stone has fewer attributes than it does. PD's page did the
  same thing with its "-" rows.

  Accepts: label, value
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="dpdp__spec">
  <dt>{{ label }}</dt>
  {%- if value != blank -%}
    <dd>{{ value }}</dd>
  {%- else -%}
    <dd class="is-unknown">&mdash;</dd>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
